OL,3,GNEWSAI didn't know my partner was
OL,4,Araping me while I slept
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In my eyes, up until maybe the day
OL,7,Fbefore he admitted to what he'd done,
OL,8,Fit was the best relationship I've ever
OL,9,Fhad."
OL,11,FAdelle Overton's boyfriend of 13 years,
OL,12,FSteven Uden, appeared to be the perfect
OL,13,Fpartner.
OL,15,FThey met on the set of a zombie film
OL,16,Fand had lots of shared interests. She
OL,17,Fsays Uden was kind and loving and even
OL,18,Fgave up work to be Overton's carer when
OL,19,Fshe became disabled.
